        "Interview trap: `const` prevents rebinding, not object mutation",
        "Interview trap: Arrow functions do not have their own dynamic `this`",
        "Interview trap: `for...in` enumerates property keys, not array values",
        "Interview trap: Promise callbacks are microtasks",
        "Interview trap: DOM APIs are host APIs, not ECMAScript language features"
