      "tradeOffs": "Advantages: Standardized language semantics, Broad browser and server adoption, Rich ecosystem, Powerful functional and object-oriented capabilities, Strong tooling and debugging support. Disadvantages: Dynamic behavior can hide runtime errors, Host environments differ, Coercion and legacy behavior can surprise candidates, Performance depends on workload and engine heuristics.",
